OL,3,GNEWSAMurder probe as police name
OL,4,Ateenager who died in Glasgow
OL,5,Adisturbance
OL,6,
OL,7,FA teenager who died following an
OL,8,Fincident in the Milton area of Glasgow
OL,9,Fhas been named as Jack Mellon, as
OL,10,Fpolice confirmed they are treating his
OL,11,Fdeath as murder.
OL,13,FThe 17-year-old was found fatally
OL,14,Finjured following a disturbance on
OL,15,FAshgill Road at about 18:05 on
OL,16,FWednesday evening.
OL,18,FEmergency services attended but he was
OL,19,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
