OL,3,GNEWSAMurder probe as police name
OL,4,Ateenager who died in Glasgow
OL,5,Adisturbance
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 22-year-old man arrested in
OL,8,Fconnection with the incident has now
OL,9,Fbeen charged. He is due to appear at
OL,10,FGlasgow Sheriff Court on Friday.
